{"id":"8c9363f0c1d91236","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-consistent-pa.md","title":"Consistent PA","display":"df-consistent-pa — Consistent PA","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-consistent-pa","aliases":["89-df-consistent-pa"],"display":"df-consistent-pa — Consistent PA","depends_on":["[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-consistent-pa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-consistent-pa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistent-pa — Consistent PA"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> is a fixed contradiction.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 是下述定义的 PA 句法一致性性质缩写，使用上述固定矛盾式与可证句子集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>PA 一致意味着固定矛盾式在 PA 中不可证</li>\n<li>PA 一致是 Gödel 第二不完备性的前提</li>\n<li>若 PA 一致，则由 Gödel 第二不完备性定理，PA 不证明其按所选证明\n编码写成的内部一致性句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>；这不是无条件的\n元语言断言“PA 一致不可证明”。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ (see [[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ (see [[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":1237,"backlinks":[{"id":"070cc23caeb65b77","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"最后一行正是 [[89-df-consistent-pa]] 在\n$\\tau_{\\sigma}(p)=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 下的实例。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-consistent-pa]]"}],"outgoing":["8f382173effd5662","86ad48bbd1843ed6"]}